    "notes": "[unparked iteration 5335] Up-scored on direct evidence: steerAuthority.steps=0 over 516k runs is a dead counter, not an inactive policy; falsifier is steps still 0 after the merge site is fixed. [rejudged iteration 5337: steerAuthority.steps=0 over 516k runs is a live wiring bug that has now voided three timer/steer evaluations; falsifier: after the merge fix steps still reads 0, or reads nonzero "
